flowchart TD
  accTitle: B4 parent intention and B2 child investigation
  accDescr: B4 retains the parent objective while B2 owns a bounded child investigation. Startup failure triggers compensating transitions; a successful return restores or reopens parent method reconsideration.
  P[Active B4 parent intention] --> O[Open bounded B2 impasse case]
  O --> D[Mark B4 intention delegated]
  D --> S[Start B2 child investigation]
  S -->|Start succeeds| C[B2 investigates child problem]
  S -->|Start fails| K[Compensate B2 case and B4 delegation]
  C --> R[Child result and parent-context fence]
  R -->|No method change| N[Return parent intention to active]
  R -->|Method reconsideration required| Q[Parent intention reconsideration pending]
  K --> P
  N --> P
